GIMP Palette
Name: Topdown Racer Golden Hour (Endesga 32 remap)
Columns: 8
# Topdown Racer project palette: "golden hour", a 32-color remap of Endesga 32.
# Source palette: Endesga 32 by ENDESGA (originally for NYKRA),
# https://lospec.com/palette-list/endesga-32 (32 colors, fetched 2026-09-08).
# This file is the authoring source of truth: all future art quantizes to it.
# No runtime loading code reads this file; it is documentation for artists.
# Remap recipe (golden-hour, deliberately raised contrast):
# - grass ramps shift warm (olive-to-golden, sunlit straw top end)
# - asphalt is a dark neutral charcoal ramp (darkest pushed near-black,
#   lighter worn tone kept for edge contrast)
# - kerb red pushed to full saturation
# - added deep near-black shadow tone + warm cream highlight
# - tree foliage darker and cooler than grass
# - exactly one amber accent
# Ramps are ordered shadow/base/light within each material family.
# --- Shadow anchors (near-black tone + soft outline dark) ---
13 10 20	Void Shadow #0d0a14
37 29 51	Dusk Outline #251d33
# --- Grass ramp (warm olive to golden) ---
76 90 36	Grass Shadow #4c5a24
110 124 48	Grass Base #6e7c30
154 160 64	Grass Light #9aa040
207 161 74	Dry Gold #cfa14a
236 205 109	Sunlit Straw #eccd6d
# --- Foliage ramp (darker and cooler than grass) + trunk ---
31 58 42	Foliage Shadow #1f3a2a
44 90 54	Foliage Base #2c5a36
74 122 68	Foliage Light #4a7a44
74 50 38	Trunk Bark #4a3226
# --- Dirt / sand Terrain Zone ramp ---
95 63 44	Dirt Shadow #5f3f2c
150 96 58	Dirt Base #96603a
216 154 94	Dirt Light #d89a5e
# --- Asphalt ramp (dark neutral charcoal; worn light kept for contrast) ---
18 16 22	Asphalt Darkest #121016
35 32 45	Asphalt Base #23202d
59 55 72	Asphalt Light #3b3748
125 118 136	Worn Edge #7d7688
# --- Kerb red ramp (saturated) ---
124 22 38	Kerb Shadow #7c1626
216 38 60	Kerb Base #d8263c
255 106 82	Kerb Light #ff6a52
# --- Car Sprite liveries (player blue is the boldest; shared glass) ---
15 143 201	Player Blue #0f8fc9
237 241 244	Rival White #edf1f4
239 106 31	Rival Orange #ef6a1f
160 74 134	Rival Plum #a04a86
27 38 50	Glass Dark #1b2632
# --- Light and signal (warm cream highlight, one amber accent) ---
255 243 212	Cream Highlight #fff3d4
255 181 46	Amber Accent #ffb52e
55 223 232	Signal Cyan #37dfe8
255 59 77	Brakelight Red #ff3b4d
23 63 102	Water Deep #173f66
230 211 163	Kerb Bone #e6d3a3
